  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup diced onion",
    "0.5 cup diced celery",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "1 teaspoon poultry seasoning",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.5 cup chicken broth",
    "2 large eggs",
    "10 cups cubed whole wheat bread",
    "0.5 cup chopped fresh parsley"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil; grease the foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dIzT4OwLuXVl4SL_ebHPndC1dfE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-VAT-step-01-4191999b71074b2eab7a4712cc4f2ae3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254890/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion and celery; cook and stir until softened, about 5 minutes. Stir in salt, poultry seasoning, and pepper; cook and stir until fragrant, about 1 minute. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1f0ZGZVWHSurZ_F-29N4O3x1Mm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-VAT-step-02-808154bfdb014f2ebf4a813cd6291ef5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254890/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, whisk chicken broth and eggs together in a large bowl. Fold in bread cubes and parsley.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9ADt8nYfHLm03ZEdK5kdJwnhnDY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-VAT-step-03-046e8e3ea7c54b9ba0729108f40ff0ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254890/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion mixture to bread cubes; mix until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DUk-j0aeGWXyGqCtFNK3Fq_i4iI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-VAT-step-04-5de31428a0334deeb63c35db8e64c516.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254890/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your hands to shape mixture into 24 (2-inch) balls; arrange on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gvLyts1pjT4nGmqjNG8YSKSEL4c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-VAT-step-05-f0156d18fa2b42b792b39995da1ce2b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254890/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden and crisp, about 20 to 25 minutes. Serve warm and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lkJ4lghlKgIZqhisc8QBnJVgoF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254890-grandma-dots-stuffing-balls-hero-03-VAT-4x3-923e16cd3d854b81a4d543647362f871.jpg"
